<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="24dp"
    android:height="24dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <!--
         Notification small icon — the brand mark (chat bubble + node-graph "M"), derived from
         src-tauri/icons/android-ic-launcher-foreground.svg.

         The launcher foreground is a SOLID white bubble with the M knocked out via an SVG <mask>
         (the blue background layer shows through the M). A notification small icon has no background
         layer and is rendered by the system as ALPHA ONLY (status bar ignores color), so the cutout
         must be expressed here as negative space via android:fillType="evenOdd": overlapping filled
         contours toggle, so the M sub-shapes drawn over the bubble subtract from it.

         The M is a node-graph — 5 dots joined by 4 strokes (per the SVG mask). evenOdd XORs overlaps,
         which would corrupt the joints if the strokes (capsules) passed under the dots. So the 4
         capsules are shortened to terminate exactly at each dot's perimeter (radius 6.5): dots and
         capsules touch but don't overlap → each toggles the bubble exactly once → a clean union cutout.

         Coordinates are the UNSCALED brand path (the launcher wraps it in scale(0.82) for a padding
         ring against the adaptive-icon mask; a notification icon should fill the viewport instead).
    -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
        android:fillType="evenOdd"
        android:pathData="
            M32 29 H76 A11 11 0 0 1 87 40 V68 A11 11 0 0 1 76 79 H52 L46 84 L41 79 H32 A11 11 0 0 1 21 68 V40 A11 11 0 0 1 32 29 Z

            M28.5 65 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 13 0 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 -13 0 Z
            M28.5 42 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 13 0 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 -13 0 Z
            M47.5 57 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 13 0 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 -13 0 Z
            M66.5 42 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 13 0 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 -13 0 Z
            M66.5 65 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 13 0 a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 -13 0 Z

            M31 58.5 L39 58.5 L39 48.5 L31 48.5 Z
            M69 48.5 L77 48.5 L77 58.5 L69 58.5 Z
            M37.62 49.17 L46.42 56.11 L51.38 49.83 L42.58 42.89 Z
            M61.58 56.11 L70.38 49.17 L65.42 42.89 L56.62 49.83 Z" />
</vector>
